<title>USA: Technology Solutions says hiring helped Q2 net.</title>
<headline>Technology Solutions says hiring helped Q2 net.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technology Solutions Co said Thursday its aggressive recruiting of experienced project managers helped fuel its growth in the second quarter.</p>
<p>The company reported second-quarter earnings of $3.7 million, compared with net income of $43,000 one year ago. Revenues in the period reached $39.5 million, up from $23.3 million in the second quarter of fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>Technology Solutions provides business and technology consulting services.</p>
<p>Its stock was up 1/8 Thursday at 41-1/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
